NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the workspace tooling in this repository: the build scripts,
Claude Code skills and subagents, configuration, documentation, and the patch
plugin sources under `src/`.

It does NOT cover, and this repository does not distribute:

  - Bethesda game assets, scripts, or plugin files.
  - Enderal: Forgotten Stories content. Enderal is by SureAI and is distributed
    under its own terms; nothing from it is committed here.
  - Any third-party mod content. Patches authored here reference other mods as
    masters, but their content remains under their authors' terms.

The `reference/`, `papyrus-source/`, `modlist/` and `downloads/` trees are all
gitignored precisely so that none of the above can be committed. You generate
them locally from your own legally-obtained copies of the game and mods.

Patch plugins built here consist of record overrides that reference FormIDs in
Enderal's and Skyrim's masters. They ship no Bethesda or SureAI assets — they
reference records and files that already exist in the player's own installation.
